{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "7bd6a982-6bb4-8afe-8f38-6d20ee91b0ed",
  "created_at": "2026-01-08T11:07:54-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Joao Teixeira",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:05:06-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:05:10-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. Yes, hello. I am calling about water, um, coming out of a pipe at the curb. Water is running and now it is ice on the sidewalk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:05:20-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, water running out of a pipe at the curb, and it's freezing. Sorry, you're a little muffled. Can you say where this is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:05:28-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry. I am on my cell phone, outside, the wind. [pause] It is 82 Coggeshall Avenue. Historic Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:05:35-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "82 Coggeshall Avenue, got it. And is this from a storm, or has it been dry out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:05:41-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No storm. No rain, no snow, this week it is dry. But the water comes out every day. Many days now. I called before about this, and it is still the same?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:05:52-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Every day, no storm, okay. I'm writing that down. So it's coming out of a pipe right at the curb, and it runs across the sidewalk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:06:01-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, from the pipe, then goes on the sidewalk and it freezes. Now it is a sheet of ice, very smooth. [line breaks up] ...can you hear me? Sorry, I put my hand like this, because of the wind."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:06:14-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's better, I can hear you. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:06:18-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I worry for the children. They walk to school on this sidewalk. And people with dogs, they walk there every morning, early. The dogs pull, and then somebody falls? Near the water, it is very slippery."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:06:30-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's a real hazard, I get it. Is the ice covering the whole sidewalk, or can people step around it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:06:38-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Most of the sidewalk. Maybe one side is small bit dry, near the fence. But the dogs, they go in the ice. I put some salt, but the water comes again and it is ice again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:06:50-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, the salt won't keep up if the water keeps running. Okay, so I've got 82 Coggeshall, constant dry-weather flow from a curb pipe, icing the sidewalk, kids and dog walkers use it. I'll put that in as a work order for Public Works to check the drainage."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:07:06-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Will there be a work order, really? And what date will they come? I would like to know the date, please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:07:14-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'm opening it right now. As for the date, they usually look at these within a few days, so probably early next week at the latest, but I'll note it as a safety issue so it gets looked at sooner. Can I get a callback number in case the office needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:07:32-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is 401-555-0185."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:07:34-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0185. And the name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:07:36-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Joao Teixeira. J-O-A-O. Teixeira, T-E-I-X-E-I-R-A."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:07:39-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, Mr. Teixeira. You're all set, the order's in. If anybody slips before they get out there, call us back right away."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:07:47-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you, Kevin. I hope they come soon. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T11:07:51-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You bet. Take care, stay warm out there."
    }
  ],
